---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"
---

<BaseLayout
  title="页面未找到"
  description="你访问的页面不存在，或已经移动到新的地址。"
  noindex
>
  <section class="not-found" aria-labelledby="not-found-title">
    <p class="status-code" aria-hidden="true">404</p>
    <p class="eyebrow">PAGE NOT FOUND</p>
    <h1 id="not-found-title">这条路径没有留下内容。</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      页面可能改了名字，也可能从未存在。可以回到首页，或者从文章与搜索重新开始。
    </p>
    <nav class="not-found__actions" aria-label="继续浏览">
      <a class="button" href="/">返回首页</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/articles/">浏览文章</a>
      <a class="text-link" href="/search/">搜索本站 →</a>
    </nav>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .not-found {
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 14vw, 9rem);
  }

  .status-code {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: var(--color-line);
    font-size: clamp(4.5rem, 20vw, 11rem);
    font-weight: 720;
    line-height: 0.78;
    letter-spacing: -0.075em;
  }

  .not-found h1 {
    max-width: 18ch;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .not-found .lede {
    max-width: 39rem;
  }

  .not-found__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .text-link {
    margin-left: 0.35rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 34rem) {
    .not-found__actions {
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .not-found__actions .button {
      flex: 1 1 auto;
    }

    .text-link {
      flex-basis: 100%;
      margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
    }
  }
</style>
